WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.259
Danny: You want me to use my imagination to make Chuck and Dave big again?

2
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.701
Brad: Yes.

3
00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:20.521
Danny: What if I refuse?

4
00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:21.896
Brad: I see.

5
00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:26.750
Brad: You don't think your imagination is strong enough, do you?

6
00:00:26.751 --> 00:00:30.930
Danny: Hey, my imagination can do anything!

7
00:00:30.931 --> 00:00:32.303
Brad: Prove it.

8
00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:39.071
Danny: I will.

9
00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.153
Danny: Why isn't it working?

10
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:42.928
Brad: I don't understand.

11
00:00:42.929 --> 00:00:44.963
I was sure it would work.

12
00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:47.192
Danny: Well, it's not my fault.

13
00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:54.800
Danny: There's nothing wrong with my imagination.

14
00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.484
Brad: Do you hear something?

15
00:00:56.485 --> 00:00:57.610
Danny: No.

16
00:00:57.611 --> 00:01:00.131
Brad: It's a high frequency noise.

17
00:01:00.132 --> 00:01:02.579
It sounds like chirping.

18
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:07.086
Danny: It's probably just crickets.

19
00:01:07.087 --> 00:01:10.299
Chuck: Help! Help!

20
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.356
Dave: If anybody can hear us, help!

21
00:01:13.357 --> 00:01:15.641
We are in danger!

22
00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:19.881
Mite Guard: Get moving, slaves!

23
00:01:19.882 --> 00:01:23.941
Brad: What were you imagining when you pulled the trigger?

24
00:01:23.942 --> 00:01:30.265
Danny: I imagined that those mean, stupid, horrible, ugly bullies were big again!

25
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:34.430
Brad: Danny, you don't really want to help Chuck and Dave, do you?

26
00:01:34.431 --> 00:01:37.015
Danny: No, not really.

27
00:01:37.016 --> 00:01:41.200
Brad: Well, I don't think you can imagine something [n3@that you don't really want.

28
00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:45.796
Danny: You mean the shrink-gun won't work because I don't want them back?

29
00:01:45.797 --> 00:01:47.651
Brad: Exactly!

30
00:01:47.652 --> 00:01:50.373
Danny: So how will we make them big again?

31
00:01:50.374 --> 00:01:53.248
Brad: The shrink-gun worked once before.

32
00:01:53.249 --> 00:01:55.188
What were you thinking then?

33
00:01:55.189 --> 00:01:59.718
Danny: I was thinking, "I wish these bullies were gone."

34
00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.874
Brad: That's it. I know how to make it work.

35
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:09.791
Danny: Good. I'll prove my imagination can do it.

36
00:02:09.792 --> 00:02:13.768
Brad: There! I just needed to make one small adjustment.

37
00:02:13.769 --> 00:02:15.979
Danny: What did you change?

38
00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:20.255
Brad: Simple. I just needed to double-reverse the polarity.

39
00:02:20.256 --> 00:02:22.964
Brad: This time, think your original thought.

40
00:02:22.965 --> 00:02:25.516
Imagine the bullies disappearing.

41
00:02:25.517 --> 00:02:30.580
Brad: Now the shrink-gun will reverse your thoughts [n3@and reverse-shrink the bullies.

42
00:02:30.581 --> 00:02:35.472
Brad: Thus, the bullies will return to normal size.

43
00:02:35.473 --> 00:02:37.481
Danny: Brad, you're a genius.

44
00:02:37.482 --> 00:02:39.488
Okay. Here's the plan.

45
00:02:39.489 --> 00:02:44.957
Danny: When the bullies are big again, we apologize for [n3@shrinking them and run for our lives.

46
00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:46.130
Danny: Are you ready?

47
00:02:46.131 --> 00:02:47.880
Brad: I'm ready.

48
00:02:47.881 --> 00:02:49.984
Danny: You're sure this will work?

49
00:02:49.985 --> 00:02:52.066
Brad: One hundred percent sure.

50
00:02:52.067 --> 00:03:08.081
Danny: I hope Chuck and Dave aren't too angry . . .
